  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-BeE4E2a6\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-BeE4E2a6\">通用Mapi方法调用</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-vMunPK8d\">通过该方法可以请求任意Mapi接口，由于安全保障<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">目前暂不支持POST写入接口调用</span>，后续会陆续开放</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-TVJVSFQM\" id=\"h346b9f0-TVJVSFQM\">函数入参</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-J2sdYc5m\">Mapi.<span style=\"color: #000000;\">requestMapi('path',param)</span></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-id=\"t61fe7cd-kJ0G6Ve9\" data-custom=\"false\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-QDQ9LFTR\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c16096d5-mNVYg6Ph\" width=\"15.717539863325742%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c679ed52-F8ajRYjG\" width=\"17.88154897494305%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0e7043f-S804hmT1\" width=\"11.617312072892938%\"><col span=\"1\" width=\"19.931662870159453%\" data-id=\"c3e3c2ef-CON33ITT\"><col data-id=\"cdaf8c2c-jaIE7Y1d\" span=\"1\" width=\"34.851936218678816%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-k5Yb95iV\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dMl4Zc7d\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-674m9QE0\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CTN44UMf\">参数名</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-G7FRN1Dl\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-INWGUXPI\">参数描述</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-PE5B4J1C\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QGg7ZjQQ\">参数格式</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-ilJ